Verification results
--------------------
- Symbolic verifier: PASS.  It exactly checks the Bargmann gauge, first-
  derivative removal, Q0/Q1/Q2, Q0=P/y^4, discriminant, double root, local
  coalescence scaling, and the eta power ladder.
- Test suite: PASS, 49 passed in 26.99 s (PYTHONPATH=src pytest -q).
- Figure generation: PASS; PDF and PNG created.
- Manuscript compilation: PASS; latexmk rebuilt the canonical
  manuscript/manuscript.pdf, 27 pages, with bibliography and references
